{"case": "n04_formal_german", "index": 2, "text": "In Germany friendship takes time, but it is deep. Here everyone is 'friend' after five minutes.", "expected_kind": null, "frame": {"kind": "ordinary", "scope": "none", "summary": "In Germany friendship takes time, but it is deep. Here everyone is 'friend' after five minutes.", "evidence": "In Germany friendship takes time, but it is deep. Here everyone is 'friend' after five minutes.", "confidence": 0.9969889521598816, "valence": 0.0, "attribute": "", "value": "", "lesson": "", "subject": "user", "scope_uncertain": false}, "reply": "That makes sense. It's a bit jarring when the threshold for connection is so low. I can see why it feels like you're just nodding at people without ever really getting to know them. Does that feel isolating to you?", "action": "COMFORT", "response_path": "reviewed_native", "seconds": 11.966603700071573, "state": {"anger": 0.019916895776987076, "sadness": 0.026975128799676895, "fear": 0.05261021479964256, "joy": 0.11256629973649979, "shame": 0.016320008784532547, "connection": 0.10407916456460953, "stress": 0.057330794632434845, "calm": 0.11235320568084717, "confusion": 0.04677979648113251, "surprise": 0.03735779970884323, "pain": 0.02219732664525509, "disgust": 0.024779997766017914, "contempt": 0.018665727227926254, "guilt": 0.018268849700689316, "pride": 0.029919322580099106, "interest": 0.0985802561044693, "awe": 0.023448102176189423, "envy": 0.025342337787151337, "vulnerability": 0.03394739702343941}, "vitality": 0.0, "depth": 0.99177025295098, "event": {"cue": "conversation:understanding", "relevance": 0.3863179489970207, "progress": 0.4239307641983032, "certainty": 0.8230839967727661, "control": 0.6417990922927856, "novelty": 0.318532794713974, "safety": 0.02979600429534912, "support": 0.42932823300361633, "effort": 0.09504389017820358, "agency": -0.12455540895462036, "aversion": 0.0017066777218133211, "comparison": 0.00017095980001613498, "vastness": 0.0008565512835048139, "devalua